  "idea": "Offboarding SOP that transitions departing clients with grace and security",
  "text": "The automated offboarding checklist that revokes access, transfers assets, and requests feedback. Agencies treat client departures as an afterthought, leading to chaotic handoffs, missing files, and awkward administrative disputes. Failing to systematically transition creative assets leaves departing clients frustrated and kills chances of future re-engagement. Connect Asana to Google Drive using Make to compile final deliverables and trigger a Typeform exit evaluation. You turn departing retainers into lifelong brand advocates.",
